Per-layer FSDP2 wrapping [94] reduced step time from ∼ 17 s to ∼ 12 . 3 s (28%). X-Cell-Ultra achieves 41% MFU on 64 H200 GPUs, comparable to Llama 3's 38-43% [95] and &gt; 20 × above prior single-cell models ( ∼ 1-16%; Supplementary Figure 7B).

