#### Training objective

Fine-tuning Gene Encoder. We adopted scGPT as the backbone of our gene encoder. Unlike its original pretraining using discretized single-cell RNA-seq data, our task required the encoder to recover continuous gene expression values. To this end, we fine-tuned scGPT on real-valued expression matrices while retaining the original model architecture. The fine-tuning objective was to jointly reconstruct both gene identity and its associated continuous expression level, enabling the encoder to better capture quantitative variation in ST data.

